  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven equation : 25 × 5 ÷ 6 + 20 = 62 − 12\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the mathematical signs:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and ÷\n\n25 × 5 ÷ 6 + 20 = 62 − 12 ⇒ 25 × 5 + **6 ÷ 20**__ = __**62 − 12**__\n\n__**25 × 5**__ + 0.3 = 50\n\n__**125 + 0.3**__ = 50\n\n125.3 ≠ 50 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ÷ and ×\n\n25 × 5 ÷ 6 + 20 = 62 − 12 ⇒ **25 ÷ 5**__ × 6 + 20 = __**62 − 12**__\n\n__**5 **____**× 6**__ + 20 = 50\n\n__30 + 20__ = 50\n\n**50 = 50 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + and −\n\n25 × 5 ÷ 6 + 20 = 62 − 12 ⇒ 25 × **5 ÷ 6**__ - 20 = __**62 + 12**__\n\n__**25 × 0.83**__ - 20 = 74\n\n__**20.75 - 20**__ = 74\n\n0.75 ≠ 74 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : + and × \n\n25 × 5 ÷ 6 + 20 = 62 − 12 ⇒ 25 + **5 ÷ 6**__ × 20 = __**62 − 12**__\n\n25 + __**0.83**____** × 20**__ = 50\n\n25 + 16.6 = 50\n\n41.6 ≠ 50 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
